text = "COPPER INGOT   difficulty 1/5\nfrom: Copper Ore -> Smelter\n\nHeavier than iron and slicker. Conductive: it grounds voltaic charge. Not ferrous, so magnets ignore it.\n\nCHALLENGE: Easy to move. The trick is separating it from iron: a magnetic belt lifts the iron and lets the copper pass."

