text = "SALT CRYSTAL   difficulty 1/5\nfrom: mined\n\nA perfect cube: stacks, packs and counts neatly. Soluble: it dissolves when wet and melts frost it touches.\n\nCHALLENGE: Keep it away from quench tanks. Used on purpose, a salt cube is the de-icer that clears a frost jam."

