text = "AEROGEL TILE   difficulty 2/5\nfrom: Floatstone -> Plate Press\n\nFrozen smoke: the lightest solid in the game. Insulating: nothing hot, cold or charged passes through it.\n\nCHALLENGE: It flutters off belts like floatstone. Laid under or between items, it's the shield that lets volatile and charged loads travel."

