text = "QUICKSILVER   difficulty 5/5\nfrom: tapped\n\nA bead of liquid metal: very heavy, frictionless and it never stops rolling. Two beads that touch merge into one bigger bead, and a hard knock splits it again.\n\nCHALLENGE: It escapes through every gap and runs down belt slopes. It has to be enclosed end to end, metered by weight and kept apart so beads don't merge."

